{"url": "https://x.com/MatthewBerman/status/2090510856950038587", "id": "2090510856950038587", "text": "Grok @bot is a personal AI agent for the mass market. \n\nThese are the use cases I'm using it for today AND how to connect it to Telegram:\n\n1. Getting to inbox zero (I don't look at emails anymore)\n2. Scheduling events and looking for meeting conflicts\n3. DMV registration, Amazon returns, doctor appointments\n4. Reading and organizing emails I get from my kids' schools\n5. Cleaning my computer from stale and bloated files.\n6. Summarizing and creating action items from meetings\n\nPlus, the Cursor team showed me how they're using Grok Bot to manage Cursor Agents now! \ud83d\udda5\ufe0f\n\n\ud83d\udc40 Watch the video here:", "raw_text": {"text": "Grok @bot is a personal AI agent for the mass market. \n\nThese are the use cases I'm using it for today AND how to connect it to Telegram:\n\n1. Getting to inbox zero (I don't look at emails anymore)\n2. Scheduling events and looking for meeting conflicts\n3. DMV registration, Amazon returns, doctor appointments\n4. Reading and organizing emails I get from my kids' schools\n5. Cleaning my computer from stale and bloated files.\n6. Summarizing and creating action items from meetings\n\nPlus, the Cursor team showed me how they're using Grok Bot to manage Cursor Agents now! \ud83d\udda5\ufe0f\n\n\ud83d\udc40 Watch the video here:", "display_text_range": [0, 597], "facets": [{"type": "mention", "indices": [5, 9], "original": "bot", "id": "2085838061347217408"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [280, 303], "id": "2090507154323292160", "display": "pic.x.com/NqvpUD9KCK", "original": "https://t.co/NqvpUD9KCK", "replacement": "https://x.com/MatthewBerman/status/2090510856950038587/video/1"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "MatthewBerman", "url": "https://x.com/MatthewBerman", "id": "6681172", "followers": 136412, "following": 714, "likes": 29796, "media_count": 2291, "name": "Matthew Berman", "description": "The future is bright.",